{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try the <i>The Vast White</i> Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a first taste of this indie open-world snowboarding adventure. In <i>The Vast White: Demo</i>, you'll begin your journey across an endless snow-covered mountain, exploring a small slice of the vast landscape and uncovering the first mysteries buried in the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650220/extras/Untitled.gif?t=1747339707\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A First Glimpse of the Mountain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely explore a section of the mountain as you carve your path through frozen peaks and hidden trails. Experience the freedom of open-world snowboarding while getting to know the game's atmosphere, visual style, and core mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Encounters and Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a few of the characters who inhabit this snowy world. Hear their stories, take on small tasks, and begin to uncover clues about the mountain's forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to see what\u2019s in store?<br>Grab your board and start exploring <i>The Vast White</i> in this free demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650220?t=1747339707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650220?t=1747339707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650220/a7f45bea92e4dad7c86ad1b0ca60c3248bde2107/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747339707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650220/a7f45bea92e4dad7c86ad1b0ca60c3248bde2107/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747339707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppo